  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "LEMUR",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEU Law Dataset \u2013 Category 15.10: Environment\n\t\n\nThis dataset contains official legal documents from the European Union, collected from the EUR-Lex website, specifically under category 15.10: \"Environment\". The documents span from the year 1961 to 2025 and are provided in multiple European \"languages. The original documents are in PDF format and have been converted into various text-based formats using OLMCR.\nThe dataset splits represent the different \"languages available for each\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/G4KMU/LEMUR.",
  "alternateName": [
    "G4KMU/LEMUR",
    "EU Law Dataset - Category 15.10"
  ],
  "creator": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Hub of Computing and Data Science (HCDS) - G4KMU",
    "url": "https://huggingface.co/G4KMU"
  },
